ent\": null,\n              \"edam\": {\n                \"edam_data\": [\n                  \"data_0872\"\n                ],\n                \"edam_formats\": [\n                  \"format_1910\"\n                ]\n              },\n              \"extensions\": [\n                \"newick\"\n              ],\n              \"help\": \"\",\n              \"help_format\": \"html\",\n              \"hidden\": false,\n              \"is_dynamic\": false,\n              \"label\": \"Tree file\",\n              \"model_class\": \"DataToolParameter\",\n              \"multiple\": false,\n              \"name\": \"input1\",\n              \"optional\": false,\n              \"options\": {\n                \"dce\": [],\n                \"hda\": [],\n                \"hdca\": [],\n                \"ldda\": []\n              },\n              \"options_meta\": {},\n              \"pinned\": {\n                \"dce\": [],\n                \"hda\": [],\n                \"hdca\": [],\n                \"ldda\": []\n              },\n              \"refresh_on_change\": true,\n              \"tag\": null,\n              \"type\": \"data\",\n              \"value\": null\n            },\n            {\n              \"argument\": null,\n              \"falsevalue\": \"\",\n              \"help\": \"\",\n              \"help_format\": \"html\",\n              \"hidden\": false,\n              \"is_dynamic\": false,\n              \"label\": \"optional argument to get all distances\",\n              \"model_class\": \"Boo\n### run_trace/galaxy_tool_schema_006/build_response.json\n{\n  \"action\": \"/tool_runner/index\",\n  \"citations\": true,\n  \"creator\": null,\n  \"credentials\": [],\n  \"description\": \"(operations on tabular data)\",\n  \"display\": true,\n  \"edam_operations\": [],\n  \"edam_topics\": [],\n  \"enctype\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\n  \"errors\": {},\n  \"form_style\": \"regular\",\n  \"has_parameters\": true,\n  \"help\": \"<p class=\\\"infomark\\\"><strong>TIP:</strong> Input data must be TAB delimited. If the desired dataset does not appear in the input list, use <em>Text Manipulation-&gt;Convert</em> to convert it to <strong>Tabular</strong> type.</p>\\n<hr class=\\\"docutils\\\" />\\n<p><strong>Syntax</strong></p>\\n<p>This tools performs common operations (such as summing, counting, mean, standard-deviation) on input file, based on tabular data. The tool can also optionaly group the input based on a given field.</p>\\n<hr class=\\\"docutils\\\" />\\n<p><strong>Example 1</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><p class=\\\"first\\\">Find the average score in statistics course of college students, grouped by their college major. The input file has three fields (Name,Major,Score) and a header line:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"literal-block\\\">\\nName        Major            Score\\nBryan       Arts             68\\nGabriel     Health-Medicine  100\\nIsaiah      Arts             80\\nTysza       Business         92\\nZackery     Engineering      54\\n...\\n...\\n</pre>\\n</li>\\n<li><p class=\\\"first\\\">Grouping the input by the second column (<em>Major</em>), sorting the input, and performing operations <strong>mean</strong> and <strong>sample standard deviation</strong> on the third column (<em>Score</em>), gives:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"literal-block\\\">\\nGroupBy(Major)     mean(Score)   sstdev(Score)\\nArts               68.9474       10.4215\\nBusiness           87.3636       5.18214\\nEngineering        66.5385       19.8814\\nHealth-Medicine    90.6154       9.22441\\nLife-Sciences      55.3333       20.606\\nSocial-Sciences    60.2667       17.2273\\n</pre>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Note that input needs sorting here, since the column used for grouping (<em>Major</em>) is not sorted.</p>\\n<p>This sample file is available at <a class=\\\"reference external\\\" href=\\\"http://www.gnu.org/software/datamash\\\">http://www.gnu.org/software/datamash</a> .</p>\\n<p><strong>Example 2</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><p class=\\\"first\\\">Using the UCSC RefSeq Human Gene Track, available at: <a class=\\\"reference external\\\" href=\\\"http://hgdownload.soe.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg38/database/refGene.txt.gz\\\">http://hgdownload.soe.ucsc.edu/goldenPath/hg38/database/refGene.txt.gz</a></p>\\n</li>\\n<li><p class=\\\"first\\\">List the number and identifiers of isoforms per gene. The gene identifier is in column 13, the isoform/transcript identifier is in column 2. Grouping by column 13 and performing <strong>count</strong> and <strong>Combine all values</strong> on column 2, gives:</p>\\n<pre class=\\\"literal-block\\\">\\nGroupBy(field-13)     count(field-2)     collapse(field-2)\\nA1BG                  1                  NM_130786\\nA1BG-AS1              \n### run_trace/galaxy_tool_schema_006/fields.json\n[\n  {\n    \"active_when\": [],\n    \"extensions\": [\n      \"tabular\",\n      \"csv\",\n      \"tsv\"\n    ],\n    \"label\": \"Input tabular dataset\",\n    \"optional\": false,\n    \"path\": \"in_file\",\n    \"type\": \"data\",\n    \"value\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"active_when\": [],\n    \"label\": \"Group by fields\",\n    \"optional\": true,\n    \"path\": \"grouping\",\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"value\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"active_when\": [],\n    \"label\": \"Sort input\",\n    \"optional\": false,\n    \"path\": \"need_sort\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"value\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"active_when\": [],\n    \"label\": \"Input file has a header line\",\n    \"optional\": false,\n    \"path\": \"header_in\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"value\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"active_when\": [],\n    \"label\": \"Print header line\",\n    \"optional\": false,\n    \"path\": \"header_out\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"value\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"active_when\": [],\n    \"label\": \"Print all fields from input file\",\n    \"optional\": false,\n    \"path\": \"print_full_line\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"value\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"activ